# Root .dockerignore for the SoundDocs web image build.
# The web image build context is the repo root (apps/web/Dockerfile is built
# with context: ..). Keep the context lean: exclude heavy / irrelevant dirs.
#
# Do NOT add supabase/migrations or supabase/functions here just to "save space"
# in a way that breaks the compose mounts -- but note those are bind-mounted by
# docker-compose at RUN time and are not needed inside the web IMAGE, so it's
# fine to exclude them from the web build context (they make the context heavier
# for no benefit). We exclude functions (Deno) but keep migrations excluded too;
# neither is used by `vite build`.

# Dependencies / build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/build

# Git / CI / editor
.git
.github
.husky
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo

# Self-host artifacts (the image doesn't need these)
self-host/.env
self-host/volumes/db/data
self-host/volumes/storage

# Local env files (never bake secrets into the image)
.env
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/*.local

# Logs
*.log
**/*.log

# Python capture agent build artifacts (irrelevant to the web build)
agents/capture-agent-py/.venv
agents/capture-agent-py/dist
agents/capture-agent-py/build
agents/capture-agent-py/__pycache__
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
agents/capture-agent-py/*.spec
agents/capture-agent-py/localhost.pem
agents/capture-agent-py/localhost-key.pem

# Supabase server-side bits not needed inside the web image (mounted by compose)
supabase/functions
supabase/migrations
supabase/.temp
supabase/.branches

# Misc
.DS_Store
*.tgz
coverage
